#2500
The Temple of The Bloodlord~
   You are standing at the very top of the Tower.  Through a narrow
window in the southern wall you can see the walls of a city far off in
the distance.  The walls of this chamber are made of a blackness darker
than obsidian, yet within their depths shimmer faint rainbows of color,
like oil on dark water.  A small tome rests upon an altar of carved
wood, holding the laws and philosophies of The Bloodlord.  The air is
cold and heavy with the smell of old blood.  A stairwell leads down from
here.
~
