#2501
The stairwell~
   A small barred window is set into the wall here, offering a narrow
glimpse of the world outside.  The stairs wind up and down the inside of
the cylindrical tower, each step worn into a shallow bowl by the feet of
the faithful.  A cold draft moans up the stairwell from below.
