#2502
The Training Chamber for the Knights of The Bloodlord~
   These training chambers are large and filled with sparring dummies,
most of which have been shredded to straw by the ferocious blades of the
Knights of The Bloodlord.  Racks of heavy black weapons line the walls,
and the stone floor is scored with countless gouges.  Steps beside the
south wall lead down to the main floor of the tower.
