#2503
Main Hallway~
   This hallway is vast, lined with torches and carpeted in the color of
blood.  The walls are the black of the darkest night, filling those not
of the faith with fear, and those who belong to The Bloodlord with a
sense of power.  An archway in the northern wall holds a staircase
leading up the cylindrical tower.  To the south the hallway leads off
between rows of flickering torches.
