#2504
The Library of the Priests of The Bloodlord~
   You stand within a library devoted to the training of the clerical
order of The Bloodlord.  Books bound in dark leather line the black
walls, holding ancient mysteries and secrets of the realm and teaching
the ways of harnessing its dark powers.  A reading lectern stands in the
center of the room, its book chained to it.  Next to the southern wall a
staircase leads down to the main hallway of the Tower.
