#2505
A small Alcove~
   This alcove opens off the west side of the main hallway of the Tower.
Flickering torches light it dimly, and a stairwell set into the northern
wall leads up to a training chamber.  You hear whispering in the
shadows, and at times you could swear that the shadows themselves are
alive.  The main hallway lies to the east.
