The Training Chambers for the Wizards of The Bloodlord~
   You stand within a small library holding the dark secrets of magic,
waiting to teach the wizards who serve The Bloodlord.  Bookshelves hold
a myriad of books, tomes and scrolls, and strange symbols have been
burned into the floor in a wide circle.  The air crackles faintly with
stored power.  A small stairway in the middle of the room leads down to
the main hallway of the Tower.
